  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 929502,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "After a domain migration, Basecamp's embed display page rendered provider-supplied HTML on the application origin instead of the isolated embeds host, so a crafted embed could run script as another account's signed-in user.\n\nWe made that check fail closed, so embed HTML renders only on the embeds host, and we now rebuild provider frames from the media id alone, so options in a pasted URL no longer reach a third-party player.\n\nThanks to deivizzzz for a thorough, well-documented report.",
